    "notes": "No amounts, baking temperature, baking time or oven/air-fryer shown (video just says bake): all amounts and the 60-minute total are guesses, so check the cake with a toothpick; a small tin should fit an air fryer, but that is not in the video. Baking powder and soda are not shown close-up (no thumbnails). Pouring the batter into the tin is not shown (only the empty tin, then walnuts on batter). Order of the dry mix is slightly unclear: ragi flour is whisked in its own bowl, then spooned into the batter along with the wheat flour."
